  "note": [
    "The table illustrates the number of bankruptcy matters at district courts. Concluded bankruptcies refers to a dismissal or rescission of a bankruptcy judgment or a decision that results in a composition arrangement.",
    "Pending bankruptcies means that a decision to declare bankruptcy has been made but the bankruptcy is not concluded yet, therefore pending bankruptcies can not be compared to the number of filed bankruptcy applications.",
    "Bankruptcy matters are excluding matters regarding requests for oath."
